クス","roleCode":"staff","roleLabel":"制作人员","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-staff:204143","source":"vndb"},{"creditedName":"コツカ","creatorId":"vndb:s20240","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s20240","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s20240","name":"コツカ","roleCode":"staff","roleLabel":"制作人员","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-staff:204144","source":"vndb"}]},"cast":[{"characterId":"char_c134866","characterName":"機堂 伊織","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"154872","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"479628"}],"egsCharacterIds":["26033"],"vndbCharacterId":"c134866"},"originalCharacterName":"機堂 伊織","characterNameSource":null,"role":"main","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"The main character who is shocked at how crossdressing suites him better than he thought."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"The protagonist of this work."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"At first, she thought cross-dressing didn't suit her and thus she didn't belong at this school.However, her hidden talent for it blossomed when she began to crossdress in protest against Mikage."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She soon becomes the envy of many students, and even earns the nickname \"The Goddess of Black Camellia\"."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Her talent for en-femme leads many to come to adore her as an older sister."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Although she soon becomes quite capable at fending off Mikage's self indulgence transgressions..."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"unknown to her, Iori's natural proficiency at trapdom has sparked an unintended romantic drama that will go beyond her wildest expectations."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"From Official Website"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c134866"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"本作の主人公。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"当初は女装が似合わない自分にはこの学園は合わないと思っていたが、御影に対抗するために女装したことによって才能が開花。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"一部の学生からは『黒椿の女神』と二つ名を付けられるほどまで羨望の対象になってしまう。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"女装によってお姉ちゃん愛が発揮され、御影の我儘も余裕で受け流すようになれたが……"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"その才能を発揮するあまり、本人の思惑を超えた恋愛劇が発展してしまうことにまだ気づいていない。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"26033","sourceWorkId":"36539","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"本作の主人公。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"当初は女装が似合わない自分にはこの学園は合わないと思っていたが、御影に対抗するために女装したことによって才能が開花。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"一部の学生からは『黒椿の女神』と二つ名を付けられるほどまで羨望の対象になってしまう。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"女装によってお姉ちゃん愛が発揮され、御影の我儘も余裕で受け流すようになれたが……"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"その才能を発揮するあまり、本人の思惑を超えた恋愛劇が発展してしまうことにまだ気づいていない。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"154872"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/85/8512d864d220f879de89d55e1c87700b29754a856624fc09826bd4b3d6650657.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/14/14e58917c4b2b89382572bb8a5215294ad5bdbaf88308405adde2d67c81c8d70.webp","width":195,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"山口瑞樹","creatorId":"vndb:s338","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s338","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s338","name":"山口 瑞樹","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:479628:154872:16462:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c134867","characterName":"白百合の妖精","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"154873","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"479628"}],"egsCharacterIds":["26034"],"vndbCharacterId":"c134867"},"originalCharacterName":"白百合の妖精","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"The prestine yet black-hearted wealthy heiress."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Contrary to her straight laced appearance, she harbors a maleficent personality."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"A powerful presence even among the many affluent families that attend Ayanohara Academy, she is a member of the Ayanohara family that owns and oversees the elite school's operation."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Appointed to student body president as a first-year student, The Ayanohara family also tasked her with the role of acting administrator to further enhance her higher education."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"How much beauty and cuteness can be produced from cross-dressing is the absolute standard by which she measures everything."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She has confidence in her appearance, is always concerned with how people see her, and possess a devilishness that makes people love her."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Has been given the nickname \"White Lily Fairy\"."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Dissatisfied with the fact that people refer to Asuka as a queen, but not to her as a princess."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"From Official Website"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c134867"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"清楚な見た目に反して腹黒い性格。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"お嬢様の集まる綾野原学園でも屈指の名門であり、経営母体である綾野原家の出身。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"一年生にして学生会長に就任、そして実家から帝王学の一環で理事長代理も任せられる。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"女装することで生まれる美しさ、可愛さが自分の中での絶対基準。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"自分の容姿に自信をもっており、常に人にどう見られているかを計算し、愛されようとする魔性を兼ね備えている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"ついた二つ名は『白百合の妖精』。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"明日香が女帝と称されているのに、 自分は姫じゃないことが不満。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"26034","sourceWorkId":"36539","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"清楚な見た目に反して腹黒い性格。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"お嬢様の集まる綾野原学園でも屈指の名門であり、経営母体である綾野原家の出身。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"一年生にして学生会長に就任、そして実家から帝王学の一環で理事長代理も任せられる。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"女装することで生まれる美しさ、可愛さが自分の中での絶対基準。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"自分の容姿に自信をもっており、常に人にどう見られているかを計算し、愛されようとする魔性を兼ね備えている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"ついた二つ名は『白百合の妖精』。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"明日香が女帝と称されているのに、 自分は姫じゃないことが不満。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"154873"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/6e/6e1f1d084aad10fbf563ee845ee3b33a57d4016f9607b2adb62c43e8003be275.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/4d/4de620796468702f4b2deee90a36c0bd39e5398b72205d4dd3e3ec05d8e0622a.webp","width":189,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"湯宮由海","creatorId":"vndb:s5006","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s5006","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s5006","name":"湯宮 由海","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:479628:154873:19558:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c134868","characterName":"村前 礼央奈","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"154874","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"479628"}],"egsCharacterIds":["26035"],"vndbCharacterId":"c134868"},"originalCharacterName":"村前 礼央奈","characterNameSource":null,"role":"side","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"The companioning prince character."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"A princely half trap."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Since he does not crossdress like the other students, just like Iori, he is considered an anomalous presence at Ayanohara academy."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"However, his aristocratic status allows him to occupy a unique prince-like role among students and is well liked by them."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"He's a good friend that helps Iori in various ways out of concern for him."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"From Official Website"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c134868"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"王子様のようなハーフの男の娘。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"女装していないので伊織と同じく異端的な存在だが、その容姿とカリスマ、貴族出身の身分であることなどから王子様的な立ち位置を許されている特別な存在。学内では絶大な人気を誇る。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"伊織のことを心配してあれこれ手助けしてくれる良き友人。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"26035","sourceWorkId":"36539","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"王子様のようなハーフの男の娘。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"女装していないので伊織と同じく異端的な存在だが、その容姿とカリスマ、貴族出身の身分であることなどから王子様的な立ち位置を許されている特別な存在。学内では絶大な人気を誇る。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"伊織のことを心配してあれこれ手助けしてくれる良き友人。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"154874"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/bc/bc2b4acd599ee75f1ee059fe9deb26b8d1284e2abb04da38ffd155aa0d09a778.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/84/84bb202c03d10594f9f23cd2b4e68e4e2044b202d3ee7472b4da8ce679e6c8b1.webp","width":186,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"汐屋早紀","creatorId":"vndb:s15651","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s15651","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s15651","name":"潮谷篭愛","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:479628:154874:32129:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c134869","characterName":"千住院真尋","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"154875","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"479628"}],"egsCharacterIds":["26036"],"vndbCharacterId":"c134869"},"originalCharacterName":"千住院真尋","characterNameSource":null,"role":"side","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"The delinquent gyaru heiress."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Asuka's younger sister. Not brother, sister."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Rejects the established traditions of her strict buttoned-up family."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Doesn't really want to dress as a woman, so she chooses to dress as a delinquent as a form of passive protest."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Refuses to accept the notion that cross dressing actually suits her well, and her choice of attire has merely made her into a cute gyaru."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Gets along with Iori as a fellow outsider and supported her decision to quit cross-dressing."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Admires Iori as a sempai for standing up for her beliefs."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Is reluctant to admit it, but owes a lot to her older sister Asuka."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"From Official Website"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c134869"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"明日香の妹、弟ではなく妹。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"堅苦しい家のしきたりに反発している。女装も本当は嫌だったが不良の恰好をしているのはせめてもの反抗。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"女装が思ったよりも似合ったため可愛いギャルになってしまっていることに本人は納得していない。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"同じ異分子である伊織とは仲が良く、自分の主張を通そうと伊織が女装を辞めようとした時は応援し、そんな伊織を先輩として慕う。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"やさぐれているが、姉である明日香には頭が上がらない。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"26036","sourceWorkId":"36539","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"明日香の妹、弟ではなく妹。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"堅苦しい家のしきたりに反発している。女装も本当は嫌だったが不良の恰好をしているのはせめてもの反抗。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"女装が思ったよりも似合ったため可愛いギャルになってしまっていることに本人は納得していない。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"同じ異分子である伊織とは仲が良く、自分の主張を通そうと伊織が女装を辞めようとした時は応援し、そんな伊織を先輩として慕う。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"やさぐれているが、姉である明日香には頭が上がらない。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"154875"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{"sex":[{"comparisonValue":"m","source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c134869","value":"m"},{"comparisonValue":"f","source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"26036","value":"女性"},{"comparisonValue":"f","source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"26036","value":"女性"},{"comparisonValue":"m","source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"154875","value":"男"}]},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/66/660a52f26c2c2034bfac3898b77d88f8113f999e3c4d59e0dc0479189f44a5ae.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/a9/a9c246a10f7130b9db1a0415ebae80005dc4bf99760e150adbef0e3406746556.webp","width":192,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"立石めぐみ","creatorId":"vndb:s646","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s646","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s646","name":"立石 めぐみ","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:479628:154875:10027:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c134870","characterName":"千住院 明日香","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"154876","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"479628"}],"egsCharacterIds":["26037"],"vndbCharacterId":"c134870"},"originalCharacterName":"千住院 明日香","characterNameSource":null,"role":"side","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"The he-iress in radiant curls."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Her pride in her own prestigious family is frequently a point of contention between her and Mikage."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She organizes and heads an extra-curricular organization called the \"Friendship Sorority\" a student group and political opposite to the Student Council led by Mikage."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She is known among students as \"Empress of the Rose Garden\"."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Crossdressing is part of her family tradition, and she embraces it gleefully."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Has upmost confident in her own beauty and behavior and isn't afraid to show it."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Is quick to chastise her younger sister Mahiro, but is otherwise intensly adoring towards her."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Her family is so wealthy that she has a personal chef for lunch, built her own private dormitory, and generally seems to have no restraint in spending her family's money whatsoever."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"If anything, her lavish spending seems to suggest she views spending money as her duty as a wealthy person."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Her opulent behaviour attracts many covetous admirers, but many enemies as well."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"From Official Website"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c134870"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"名門出身のプライドゆえに御影とたびたび衝突する。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"友愛会という私的な団体を組織してその長におさまり、御影率いる学生会と政治的に対抗している。人呼んで『薔薇園の女帝』。 女装は家のしきたりだが、喜んでそれを受け入れている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"自分の美しさや行動には絶対の自信があり、周囲にもそれを隠さない。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"妹の真尋には苦言を呈することも多いが、基本的には溺愛している。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"実家があまりにも裕福すぎて、昼食に料理人を呼びこんだり、自分専用の寮を建築したり、金の使い道に躊躇がなく、むしろ金を使う事が持てる者の義務であるかのように行動する。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"その貴族的な振る舞いに羨望する学生は多いが、敵も多い。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"26037","sourceWorkId":"36539","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"名門出身のプライドゆえに御影とたびたび衝突する。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"友愛会という私的な団体を組織してその長におさまり、御影率いる学生会と政治的に対抗している。人呼んで『薔薇園の女帝』。 女装は家のしきたりだが、喜んでそれを受け入れている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"自分の美しさや行動には絶対の自信があり、周囲にもそれを隠さない。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"妹の真尋には苦言を呈することも多いが、基本的には溺愛している。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"実家があまりにも裕福すぎて、昼食に料理人を呼びこんだり、自分専用の寮を建築したり、金の使い道に躊躇がなく、むしろ金を使う事が持てる者の義務であるかのように行動する。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"その貴族的な振る舞いに羨望する学生は多いが、敵も多い。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"154876"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{"sex":[{"comparisonValue":"m","source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c134870","value":"m"},{"comparisonValue":"f","source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"26037","value":"女性"},{"comparisonValue":"f","source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"26037","value":"女性"},{"comparisonValue":"m","source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"154876","value":"男"}]},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/39/397f15ee6c013213568d796ff6138feb4a39d3ab7446d1a169df95cb6a73935c.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/07/07d789063fea978c5071cfabe892d01dc82171b94052991ad9194aa9102ee8cb.webp","width":179,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"高桑まりか","creatorId":"vndb:s8888","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s8888","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s8888","name":"高桑 まりか","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:479628:154876:20835:1","source":"bangumi"},{"creditedName":"すずな","creatorId":"vndb:s8148","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s8148","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s8148","name":"すずな","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:97131","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_c134871","characterName":"桐山 志津香","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"154877","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"479628"}],"egsCharacterIds":["26038"],"vndbCharacterId":"c134871"},"originalCharacterName":"桐山 志津香","characterNameSource":null,"role":"side","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"The childish teacher."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Iori and Reona's homeroom teacher."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She is popular among students for her cute un-teacher-like appearance, and is doted on by everyone she meets."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"When she gets upset, she pouts and throws tantrums, but that only makes people find her even more adorable."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"From Official Website"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c134871"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"伊織と礼央奈の担任教師。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"教師とは思えぬ容姿とかわいらしさで学生たちから人気が高く、ちゃんづけされて周囲から愛されている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"むくれるとへそを曲げて駄々をこねるが、その様子さえ可愛いらしいと評判。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"26038","sourceWorkId":"36539","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"伊織と礼央